{"id":"diffe_remment","lemma":"différemment","pos":"adv","rank":2785,"glosses":["differently"],"ipa":"/di.fe.ʁa.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d2/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-diff%C3%A9remment.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-diff%C3%A9remment.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Que ferais-tu différemment ?","en":"What would you do differently?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Je pense juste différemment.","en":"I just think differently.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"fair, just"},null]},{"text":"Qu'aurais-tu fait différemment ?","en":"What would you have done differently?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},null]},{"text":"Beaucoup de gens voient ça différemment.","en":"Many people see that differently.","words":[{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"that"},null]},{"text":"La prochaine fois, on fera ça différemment.","en":"Next time, we'll do this differently.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"upcoming","l":"prochain"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"that"},null]}]}